{"unit_id": "tag:0GKC:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），使得<MATH_0002>的每个拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）都有有限（finite）个不可约分支（irreducible components）（例如，若<MATH_0003>具有 Noether（Noetherian）底层拓扑空间（topological space），或者若<MATH_0004>局部 Noether（locally Noetherian））。设<MATH_0005>为 Noether 环（Noetherian ring）。设<MATH_0006>为层（sheaf），其为<MATH_0007>-模（modules），定义于<MATH_0008>上。以下条件等价（equivalent）<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0009>是有限型（finite type）、局部常值（locally constant）层（sheaf），其为<MATH_0010>-模（modules），且\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0011>的所有茎（stalks）都是有限（finite）<MATH_0012>-模（modules），并且所有特殊化（specialization）映射（maps）<MATH_0013>都是双射（bijective）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "Noether"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部 Noether"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "Noether 环"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "locally constant", "target_term": "局部常值"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特殊化"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集", "context": "暂定译法。"}, {"source